Additional Use Grant

Subject to the terms and conditions of this License, the Licensor hereby grants
you the right to use, copy, modify, and redistribute the Licensed Work,
provided that all of the following conditions are met:

1. **Project Name:** The name "ÇAKAL" (or "CAKAL") must not be removed or
   replaced when distributing or deploying a modified version of the Licensed
   Work. Any modified version must clearly state that it is a derivative of
   ÇAKAL and must not misrepresent itself as the original work.

2. **Purpose:** The core purpose of the Licensed Work — a personal, single-user
   AI-powered investment research and opportunity assistant — must not be
   changed to a multi-tenant SaaS product, a fully automated trading system,
   or any application that autonomously executes financial transactions on
   behalf of users without explicit per-action user confirmation.

3. **Surgical Pipeline Integrity:** The `surgery/` directory and its
   `protected-paths` mechanism must not be removed, disabled, or circumvented
   in any distributed or deployed version. The two-layer permission gate
   (hard-block layer + user-confirmation layer) that governs source-code
   modifications must remain fully operational.

4. **Decision Guards:** The deterministic decision locks (`decision-guards.cjs`,
   `karar kilidi`) that prevent AL/SAT (BUY/SELL) verdicts without sufficient
   fresh evidence must not be removed or weakened.

